settlements.summary:
You received out-of-network mental health or substance use disorder care after January 1, 2021;

You were a Kaiser Permanente member in California (Northern or Southern California region) at the time you received that out-of-network care; and

Before going out of network, you attempted to obtain in-network mental health or substance use disorder services from Kaiser Permanente but were unable to access timely care, and you paid (or are currently obligated to pay) out of pocket for the out-of-network care.
